      ],
      "en": "So Abijah slept with his fathers, and they buried him in David’s city; and Asa his son reigned in his place. In his days, the land was quiet ten years.",
      "ko": "아비야가 그 열조와 함께 자매 다윗성에 장사되고 그 아들 아사가 대신하여 왕이 되니 그 시대에 그 땅이 십년을 평안하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "c8f65e73e6e514c60b671798924ee97d95dd90eabc2ccd3b90ffea22c26a75d4",
      "translation_text_hash": "460cfee6726ff06083a11954b448a0b1e6c0a96e614ef1d173af29bfd74bfbee",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
