        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 14,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Asa did that which was good and right in the LORD his God’s eyes,",
      "ko": "아사가 그 하나님 여호와 보시기에 선과 정의를 행하여",
      "source_text_hash": "9e979aa95d974b4dd51f29b1943dc534019be01152fa18d578be7eb112034a5f",
      "translation_text_hash": "e32981c920907cd105b10d5ad664df8bda3910f3bd84286fa7ebf951983e2bb8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "아사가 그 하나님 여호와 보시기에 선과 정의를 행하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e32981c920907cd105b10d5ad664df8bda3910f3bd84286fa7ebf951983e2bb8"
      ]
    },
    {
